# The pilot loop through a lesson's chapters: swaps, flips, the egg, a fan,
# a puzzle and a mission. Every claim holds.
kits scb20
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at 1A dir=right side=up level=1
step 3: S1 at 1C dir=down level=1
step 4: L4 at 3E dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at 1A dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at 1E dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at 3C dir=up level=2
change colours: swap=4/D10
change lantern: base=colours, add=4/egg
change horn: swap=3/S2, swap=4/W1, flip=4
change spinner: swap=4/M7, add=4/fan7
puzzle backwards: base=colours, S1=on, flip=4
mission red-button: swap=3/S2, swap=4/D10 => S2=pressed: D10 red; S2=released: D10 off
scene lantern: base=lantern, S1=on
expect base=colours, S1=on: D10 red
expect base=colours, S1=on, flip=4: D10 yellow
expect base=horn, S2=pressed: W1 off
expect base=horn, S2=pressed, flip=4: W1 on
expect base=spinner, S1=on: M7 on fwd
expect base=spinner, S1=on, flip=4: M7 on rev
